    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA______________________________________________________________________________\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 10.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nBUDGETARY RELIEF ALLOWANCE OF WORKERS (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 9 OF 2025\n\n[Certi\ufb01 ed on 23rd of July, 2025]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka of July 25, 2025\n\n1Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment)\n\nAct, No. 9 of 2025\n\nShort title and date of operation\n\nAmendment of section 3 of Act, No. 36 of 2005\n\nSinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency\n\nL.D.-O 20/2025\n\nAn Act to amend the Budgetary Relief Allowance of\n\nWorkers Act, No. 36 of 2005\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment) Act, No. 9 of 2025.\n\n(2) The provisions of this Act shall be deemed to have come into operation on April 1, 2025.\n\n2. Section 3 of the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 36 of 2005 is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for the words and figures \"With effect from August 1, 2005\", of the words and figures \"For the period commencing on August 1, 2005 and ending on March 31, 2025, \".\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n[Certified on 23rd of July, 2025]\n\nBudgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment) Act,\n\nNo. 9 of 20252\n\nEnglish Acts of the Parliament can be purchased at the \u201cPrakashana Piyasa\u201d, Department of\n\nGovernment Printing, No. 118, Dr. Danister De Silva Mawatha, Colombo 8."
